{'symbol': 'ODFL', 'date': '2022-01-21 11:45:00', 'title': 'OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE RELEASES INAUGURAL ESG REPORT', 'text': "THOMASVILLE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ODFL--OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE, INC. (NASDAQ: ODFL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE RELEASE OF ITS INAUGURAL ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT. THE 2020 ESG REPORT INCLUDES DATA FROM 2018 TO 2020 AND UTILIZES THE SUSTAINABILITY ACCOUNTING STANDARDS BOARD (SASB) ROAD TRANSPORTATION SUSTAINABILITY ACCOUNTING STANDARD. THE ESG REPORT IS AVAILABLE UNDER THE CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S INVESTOR WEBSITE AT IR.ODFL.COM. “WE ARE PROUD TO RELEASE"}